// Developer-local Xcode build settings.
//
// Usage:
//   cp LocalOverride.xcconfig.template LocalOverride.xcconfig
//
// LocalOverride.xcconfig is in .gitignore — never commit it.
// Settings declared here apply to the project via Xcode's
// "Based On" mechanism. To wire it in, add the file manually
// in Xcode → Project → Info → Configurations, or uncomment
// the configFiles block in project.yml (then run xcodegen generate).
//
// ── Kernel entitlements (paid developer account required) ─────────────────────
// Unlocks generous memory tier: 4096-token context, 128 MB MLX cache,
// full image budget, and safe loading of models > 2 GB.
// Requires com.apple.developer.kernel.* entitlements added in Xcode →
// Signing & Capabilities.  See KERNEL_ENTITLEMENTS.md.
//
// SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS = $(inherited) HOMEHUB_HAS_KERNEL_ENTITLEMENTS
//
// ── llama.cpp backend (optional, framework must be placed separately) ──────────
// See project.yml header for the full opt-in checklist.
//
// SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS = $(inherited) HOMEHUB_LLAMA_RUNTIME
// GCC_PREPROCESSOR_DEFINITIONS = $(inherited) HOMEHUB_LLAMA_RUNTIME=1
//
// ── SwiftData persistence (replaces JSON FileStore) ───────────────────────────
//
// SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS = $(inherited) HOMEHUB_SWIFTDATA
